#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:17
msgid ""
"*PlatformIO* can build the same binary code under different host systems via "
"the single command :ref:`cmd_run` without any dependent software or "
"requirements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:21
msgid ""
"A *manifest* describes how to produce binaries for a particular platform "
"under one or multiple host systems by a set of build scripts, toolchains, "
"the settings for the most popular embedded boards, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:25
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to write manifests, to support building for new "
"development platforms."
msgstr ""

