#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:127
msgid ""
"PlatformIO's build script is based on a next-generation build tool named "
"`SCons <http://www.scons.org>`_. PlatformIO has its own built-in firmware "
"builder ``env.BuildProgram`` with deep library search. Please see the "
"following template as start for developing your own ``main.py``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:211
msgid "Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:213
msgid "Using the \"myplatform\" platform example above:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:215
msgid ""
"Create a ``platforms`` directory in :ref:`projectconf_pio_core_dir` if it "
"doesn't exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:217
msgid "Create a ``myplatform`` directory in ``platforms``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:218
msgid ""
"Copy the ``platform.json`` and ``builder/main.py`` files to the "
"``myplatform`` directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/creating_platform.rst:219
msgid ""
"Search the available platforms via the :ref:`cmd_platform_search` command. "
"You should see the new ``myplatform`` platform."
msgstr ""

